                    <div class="row">
                        

    <div id="featureImage">
        <img alt='Image of international students' src='/media/rlobifac/dcs-getglobalready.jpg' class='main img-fluid'/>
    </div>
    <div class="dcs-border-bottom margin-bottom-30">
    <h1>Continuing Studies at UVic international programs</h1>
</div>

<div class="entry-content">
    <h2>Let's get global ready.</h2>
<div class="row mb-4">
<div class="col-lg-6">
<p>In Continuing Studies at the University of Victoria (UVic), we believe in the power of international education and training to build connections, enhance innovation and prepare you to become a successful global citizen.</p>
<p>Here's what getting "global ready" looks like:</p>
<h3>An interconnected world</h3>
<p>Working well together across borders, boundaries and differences is essential to solving the complex issues of our time. Our international programs focus on developing advanced communication skills and engaging with real-world issues through active, competency-based learning.</p>
<h3>A unique experience</h3>
<p>Every educational journey is different. Improve your language skills to live or work abroad and learn about different cultures to develop new collaboration skills. As you approach your goals from new angles, the new knowledge and skills you’ll gain will further your future success.</p>
<h3>Building relationships</h3>
<p>We are proud to work collaboratively with many international partners to provide the resources you need to build professional networks and lifelong connections around the world.</p>
</div>
<div class=" col-lg-6 col-sm-10 my-2">
<div class="card dcs-blue ms-3">
<div class="responsive-video card-img-top"><iframe width="560" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/APz6MI_YHvA" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen"></iframe></div>
<div class="card-body text-center dcs-blue">
<p class="card-text">Watch video: Get Global Ready</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<h2 class="mt-4">What we offer</h2>
<div class="narrow-text">
<p>If you're a student, professional or an organization, we can help you thrive and reach your personal or professional goals. Let’s take a closer look at how you can get global ready:</p>
</div>
<div class="py-2 mb-1 global-ready-tabs"><!-- Nav pills -->
<ul class="nav nav-tabs text-center d-flex  flex-md-nowrap flex-sm-wrap justify-content align-self-stretch">
<li class="nav-item align-self-stretch"><a href="#Glance" class="nav-link active text-black h-100 border" data-bs-toggle="pill"><i class="fal fa-books fa-2x">&nbsp;</i><br>Overview</a></li>
<li class="nav-item align-self-stretch"><a href="#English" class="nav-link h-100 border" data-bs-toggle="pill"><i class="fal fa-comments fa-2x">&nbsp;</i><br>Improve your English</a></li>
<li class="nav-item align-self-stretch"><a href="#Degree" class="nav-link h-100 border" data-bs-toggle="pill"><i class="fal fa-graduation-cap fa-2x">&nbsp;</i><br>Pursue a degree or diploma</a></li>
<li class="nav-item align-self-stretch"><a href="#Skills" class="nav-link h-100 border" data-bs-toggle="pill"><i class="fal fa-briefcase fa-2x">&nbsp;</i><br>Gain professional skills</a></li>
<li class="nav-item align-self-stretch"><a href="#Teaching" class="nav-link h-100 border" data-bs-toggle="pill"><i class="fal fa-chalkboard-teacher fa-2x">&nbsp;</i> <br>Enhance your teaching</a></li>
<li class="nav-item align-self-stretch"><a href="#Customized" class="nav-link h-100 border" data-bs-toggle="pill"><i class="fal fa-cog fa-2x">&nbsp;</i><br>Customize team training</a></li>
</ul>
<!-- Tab panes -->
<div class="tab-content bg-white">
<div id="Glance" class="container tab-pane active">
<h3>Welcome to the Division</h3>
<div class="row mb-4">
<div class="col-md-7">
<p>The <a href="/help-centre/about/continuing-studies/">Division of Continuing Studies</a> offers a wide variety of adult education options for UVic international students and professionals. Our innovative programs are designed by industry-leading experts to advance learners in their academic and career goals. Learners enhance their language and/or professional skill sets through programs delivered in on-campus, online or hybrid formats.</p>
<p>With extensive resources, specialized instructors and collaborative networks at UVic and beyond, offering students a global education is what we do best!</p>
<p><i class="fal fa-lg fa-book-open">&nbsp;</i> <a rel="noopener" href="https://pubhtml5.com/ggaa/djtz/" target="_blank" title="Interactive PDF" class="no-linkicon">View Get Global Ready Booklet (interactive PDF)</a></p>
<p><i class="fal fa-lg fa-file-pdf">&nbsp;</i> <a rel="noopener" href="/media/h4rg5i1m/dcs-international-programsataglance.pdf" target="_blank" title="DCS International Programsataglance">Download Programs at a Glance Handout (PDF)</a></p>
</div>
<div class="col-md-5"><img class="img-fluid " src="/media/rtwe3qvv/getglobalready-dcsbuilding.jpg" alt="Photo of students walking outside the Continuing Studies building on a summer day"></div>
</div>
</div>
<div id="English" class="container tab-pane fade">
<h3>Improve your English</h3>
<div class="row mb-4">
<div class="col-md-7">
<p>UVic's award-winning<a href="/elc" title="English Language Centre"> English Language Centre</a> (ELC) is home to a multicultural community of students pursuing unique language-learning goals (through on-campus or online studies). We are committed to your support and success, which is why our program staff coordinate every aspect of the experience so you can focus on classes, enjoy activities and deepen your cultural competencies as global citizens.</p>
<h3>10+ week programs</h3>
<ul>
<li><a href="/elc/programs/elpi-intensive-english" title="ELPI - Intensive English">Intensive English ELPI</a>
<ul>
<li>January, April, September ELPI (12 weeks)</li>
<li>Summer ELPI (10 weeks)</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Intensive English + <a href="/elc/programs/project-based-presentations" title="Project-based Presentations">Project-based Presentations (PbP)</a></li>
</ul>
<h3>2-6 week programs</h3>
<ul>
<li><a href="/elc/programs/language-culture" title="Language and Culture">Language and Culture</a>&nbsp;<a href="/elc/programs/online-conversation-lounge-membership" title="Online Conversation Lounge Membership"></a></li>
<li><a href="/elc/programs/english-communication-for-healthcare" title="English Communication for Healthcare" data-anchor="#">English Communication for Healthcare</a></li>
<li><a href="/elc/programs/cultural-discovery" title="Cultural Discovery">Cultural Discovery (online)</a></li>
</ul>
<a href="/elc/programs/customized-english-for-global-communication-egc" title="English for Global Communication (EGC)"></a>
<p><a href="/elc/programs" title="Programs" class="btn btn-default">View all English programs</a></p>
</div>
<div class="col-md-5">
<div class="card dcs-blue ms-3">
<div class="responsive-video card-img-top"><iframe width="560" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/xudtWQSpGak" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen"></iframe></div>
<div class="card-body text-center dcs-blue">
<p class="card-text">Get Global Ready: Improve your English</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div id="Degree" class="container tab-pane fade">
<h3>Pursue a degree or diploma</h3>
<div class="row mb-4">
<div class="col-md-7">
<p>Studying English is often the first step if you want to further pursue academic or professional studies at UVic. The ELC offers many options to get you closer to your goals:</p>
<h4>University Admission Preparation (UAP)</h4>
<p>An advanced English program for those who meet UVic’s admission requirements (except for English proficiency). Many UAP learners qualify for conditional admission, with a passing UAP grade satisfying the English requirement, for entry into their UVic undergraduate degree. <a href="/elc/programs/university-admission-preparation-uap" title="University Admission Preparation (UAP)">Learn more about UAP.</a></p>
<h4>UVic Pathway</h4>
<p>This first-year program allows you to meet UVic's English language requirement while completing academic credit courses as part of an undergraduate degree. <a href="/elc/programs/university-pathway-program" title="University Pathway Program">Learn more about Pathway.</a></p>
<h4>ELC Preliminary Admission</h4>
<p>Do you want to enter undergraduate degree programs at the University of Victoria (UVic)? The ELC Preliminary Admission is designed to help you meet UVic’s English requirements within 24 months.Learn more about ELPI.&nbsp;<a href="/elc/programs/elc-preliminary-admission" title="ELC Preliminary Admission">Learn more about Preliminary Admission</a>.</p>
<p><a href="/elc/topics/university-preparation-programs" title="University Preparation Programs" class="btn btn-default">View all University Prep programs</a></p>
</div>
<div class="col-md-5">
<div class="card dcs-blue ms-3">
<div class="responsive-video card-img-top"><iframe width="560" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/VFtauWS4lTw" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen"></iframe></div>
<div class="card-body text-center dcs-blue">
<p class="card-text">Get Global Ready: Pursue a degree or diploma</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div id="Skills" class="container tab-pane fade">
<h3>Gain professional skills</h3>
<div class="row mb-4">
<div class="col-md-7">
<p>An incredible community of international learners choose to get global ready through our online, and face-to-face, business programs at Continuing Studies.</p>
<p>Our certificate, diploma and micro-certificate programs will support you with learning about current business practices, leadership skills, communication strategies, marketing, analytics, new technologies and more.</p>
<p>Students in these programs are eligible to work part-time during their studies, and full-time during scheduled breaks. The DIGM and DAMS programs (see below) also meet the eligibility requirements by&nbsp;<a href="/international-students/travelling-to-canada/ircc-updates-frequently-asked-questions">Immigration, Refugees and Citizenship Canada (IRCC)</a> for application to the&nbsp;<a href="/international-students/living-in-canada/working-in-canada/post-graduation-work-permit-information-session">Post Graduate Work Permit (PGWP).</a></p>
<h4>Business programs:</h4>
<ul>
<li><a href="/business-and-management/programs/business-administration-certificate">Certificate in Business Administration (CBA)</a></li>
<li><a href="/business-and-management/programs/business-administration-diploma">Diploma in Business Administration (DBA)</a></li>
<li><a href="/ai-data-technology/programs/data-analytics" title="Data Analytics">Certificate in Data Analytics (CDA)</a></li>
<li><a href="/data-computing-and-technology/programs/data-analytics-for-management-science">Diploma in Data Analytics for Management Science (DAMS)</a></li>
<li><a href="/business-and-management/programs/digital-marketing" title="Digital Marketing">Diploma in Digital Marketing (DIGM)</a></li>
<li><a href="/business-and-management/programs/trade-and-construction-management" title="Trade and Construction Management">Certificate inTrade and Construction Management (TCM)</a></li>
</ul>
<p><a href="/business-and-management/programs" title="Programs" class="btn btn-default">View more Business programs</a></p>
</div>
<div class="col-md-5">
<div class="card dcs-blue ms-3">
<div class="responsive-video card-img-top"><iframe width="560" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/ffrF9-6OVHg" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen"></iframe></div>
<div class="card-body text-center dcs-blue">
<p class="card-text">Get Global Ready: Gain Professional Skills</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div id="Teaching" class="container tab-pane fade">
<h3>Enhance your teaching</h3>
<div class="row mb-4">
<div class="col-md-7">
<p>The ELC's expertise in English language programming includes professional development training if you are an international educator who teaches English, or teaches their subject area(s) in English. Academic and curriculum specialists at the ELC develop a variety of options for pre-service and in-service international educators, covering fields from early childhood education to the post-secondary level.</p>
<p>In these programs, you’ll explore education-related topics from a Canadian perspective while building a professional network. Our interactive learning environment allows you to develop confident English communication skills and to enhance teaching methodologies so you can teach more effectively in your home country.</p>
<h4>Programs for International Educators:</h4>
<ul>
<li><a href="/elc/programs/customized-english-as-a-medium-of-instruction" title="Customized English as a Medium of Instruction">Customized English as a Medium of Instruction</a></li>
<li><a href="/elc/programs/customized-teaching-english-as-a-foreign-language" title="Customized Teaching English as a Foreign Language">Customized Teaching English as a Foreign Language</a></li>
</ul>
<p>To arrange a program for your group, please <a href="/study-options/custom-learning-solutions/international-cls/lets-connect?QuestionsBox" data-anchor="?QuestionsBox">contact us</a>.</p>
<p><a href="/elc/topics/teacher-training-programs" title="Teacher Training Programs" class="btn btn-default">More about teacher training programs</a></p>
</div>
<div class="col-md-5">
<div class="card dcs-blue ms-3">
<div class="responsive-video card-img-top"><iframe width="560" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/GK3jZP17Ua0" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen"></iframe></div>
<div class="card-body text-center dcs-blue">
<p class="card-text">Get Global Ready: Enhance your teaching</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div id="Customized" class="container tab-pane fade">
<h3>Customize team training</h3>
<div class="row">
<div class="col-md-7">
<p>Continuing Studies has extensive experience offering customized, international training programs to institutional, corporate and government groups.</p>
<p>We use a collaborative three-step process to develop specialized training programs that equip you with fresh, relevant skills to prepare you for success in your studies and careers.</p>
<img src="/media/v3ypu4il/customized-1.jpg?width=400&amp;height=71" alt="Blue bar with the word Discovery." width="300">
<p>We work with you to better understand your current situation and your team’s learning needs or goals.</p>
<img src="/media/gn2mqous/customized-2.jpg?width=400&amp;height=71" alt="Blue bar with the word Design." width="300">
<p>We identify your priority learning objectives, and program elements, and then collaborate with our team of advisers, educators and real-world experts to design a program uniquely suited to your group.</p>
<img src="/media/oyzp2z4l/customized-3.jpg?width=400&amp;height=71" alt="Blue bar with the word Delivery." width="300">
<p>Our instructors deliver your customized program, ensuring your expectations are met, and provide opportunities for reflection and feedback.</p>
<p><a href="/study-options/custom-learning-solutions/international-cls" title="International Custom Learning Solutions" class="btn btn-default mb-2">Learn more about customized team training</a></p>
</div>
<div class="col-md-5">
<div class="card dcs-blue ms-3">
<div class="responsive-video card-img-top"><iframe width="560" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/MxinOCNgFP4" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen"></iframe></div>
<div class="card-body text-center dcs-blue">
<p class="card-text">Get Global Ready: Customize team training</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<div class="dcs-lightblue-box rounded-2x">
<div class="row mt-3 pb-2">
<div class="col-sm-7 order-sm-2">
<h2>Why choose Continuing Studies at UVic?</h2>
<p>As a UVic international student, you’ll be studying at one of the best universities in Canada. UVic is consistently ranked as one of Canada’s&nbsp;<a rel="noopener" href="https://www.uvic.ca/about-uvic/rankings-reputation/index.php" target="_blank">top-ranked comprehensive universities</a>. Since UVic started in 1963, Continuing Studies has been an integral part of campus, providing adult and continuing education programming to domestic and international students. We partner with all UVic faculties to provide stimulating, high-quality education opportunities to local and international learners.</p>
</div>
<div class="col-sm-5 order-sm-1"><img class="img-fluid pe-3" src="/media/e3tpabl1/getglobalready-whydcs.jpg?width=500&amp;height=333.33333333333337" alt="Photo of UVic student holding workbooks and smiling at the camera." width="500" height="333.33333333333337"></div>
</div>
<h3>If you choose to study with Continuing Studies at UVic, you’ll benefit from:</h3>
<div class="row pt-2">
<div class="col-sm-6">
<div class="row margin-bottom-20 sm-text-center">
<div class="col-lg-2 col-md-3 col-sm-2  text-center"><img class="img-responsive img-inline no-padding center-block" src="/upload/DCS/international-programming/IPP-networking.png" alt=""></div>
<div class="col-lg-10 col-md-9 col-sm-10"><strong>International experience</strong> – We have a long history of offering customized and scheduled programming to learners from around the world. As an international student at UVic, you can expect world-class education with a global perspective, preparing you for wherever your studies or career lead you in the future.</div>
</div>
<div class="row margin-bottom-20 sm-text-center">
<div class="col-lg-2 col-md-3 col-sm-2  text-center"><img class="img-responsive img-inline no-padding center-block" src="/upload/DCS/international-programming/IPP-instructors.png" alt=""></div>
<div class="col-lg-10 col-md-9 col-sm-10"><strong>Welcoming environments</strong> – We aspire to create an intercultural community that promotes harmony and understanding between everyone. Our academic programs are complemented by social activities where you can meet new friends and share the unique aspects of your country or culture in a safe, respectful environment.</div>
</div>
<div class="row margin-bottom-20 sm-text-center">
<div class="col-lg-2 col-md-3 col-sm-2  text-center"><img class="img-responsive img-inline no-padding center-block" src="/upload/DCS/international-programming/IPP-awards.png" alt=""></div>
<div class="col-lg-10 col-md-9 col-sm-10"><strong>English-language development</strong> – Our award-winning team of English language specialists (in the ELC programs) are here to help you develop your English skills and prepare you for further studies or a career in an international market.</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="col-sm-6">
<div class="row margin-bottom-20 sm-text-center">
<div class="col-lg-2 col-md-3 col-sm-2  text-center"><img class="img-responsive img-inline no-padding center-block" src="/upload/DCS/international-programming/IPP-online-learning.png" alt=""></div>
<div class="col-lg-10 col-md-9 col-sm-10"><strong>Talented experts</strong> – Learn from a team of experienced instructors and presenters who are real-world experts, delivering relevant and practical content in your field of study. To bring a truly global perspective to your studies, there will be many opportunities to network and make long-lasting connections.</div>
</div>
<div class="row margin-bottom-20 sm-text-center">
<div class="col-lg-2 col-md-3 col-sm-2 "><img class="img-responsive img-inline no-padding center-block" src="/upload/DCS/international-programming/IPP-support.png" alt=""></div>
<div class="col-lg-10 col-md-9 col-sm-10"><strong>Dedicated on-campus support</strong> – We understand it can be scary and challenging to move to a new country. Our student services and specialized support staff are here to help you every step of the way—before, during and after your studies. Students have access to the Student Wellness Centre, Campus Security Services 24/7, Virtual Centre for Student Learning, Immigration advising, Career counselling and more. <a href="/international-students/living-in-canada/international-student-services">Learn more about Student Services</a>.</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="row mt-4">
<div class="col-sm-6 pb-5"><img class="img-fluid pe-3" src="/media/yo1k4eyy/uvic-aerialmap.jpg" alt="Detailed aerial map of the UVic campus, showing that campus is located right on the scenic ocean and that there are many amenities within walking distance."></div>
<div class="col-sm-6">
<h2>About UVic and Continuing Studies</h2>
<p><strong>World-class education in Canada’s best small city</strong></p>
<p>With extensive resources, specialized instructors and collaborative networks at UVic and beyond, getting global ready is what we do best. <a href="/international-students/living-in-Canada/about-uvic">Learn more about UVic.</a></p>
<h3>UVic highlights</h3>
<ul>
<li>#1 Canadian comprehensive university for graduate employability</li>
<li>22,020 students (undergraduate and graduate)</li>
<li>International students from over 100 countries</li>
<li>5,000 employees, including 900 full-time faculty members</li>
<li>15 minutes to downtown Victoria; 15 minutes to the beach</li>
<li>Natural campus environment with gardens, hiking trails and wildlife</li>
</ul>
<h3>The English Language Centre (ELC)</h3>
<p>If you're an international student where English is not your first language, we offer a variety of academic and professional programs through the English Language Centre (ELC). The ELC has been delivering high-quality intensive English language programs at UVic since 1970 and is one of the largest English schools for foreign students in Canada. <a href="/elc">Learn more about the ELC.</a></p>
</div>
<div class="row">
<div class="col-md-6">
<div class="card">
<div class="responsive-video card-img-top dcs-blue"><iframe width="560" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/8e3pN7zkXcY" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen="allowfullscreen"></iframe></div>
<div class="card-body dcs-blue text-center">
<p class="card-text">Watch video: What's it like to live in Victoria, BC?</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="col-md-6">
<h2 class="mt-3">About Victoria, BC</h2>
<p>Victoria is a vibrant city on Vancouver Island and Canada’s spectacular West Coast. Famous for its natural environment, mild climate and welcoming community, Victoria’s relaxed island lifestyle makes it the perfect place to live and learn for international students.</p>
<h3>Victoria facts and highlights:</h3>
<ul>
<li>Population of Greater Victoria: 400,000+</li>
<li>Capital city of British Columbia</li>
<li>Approximately 30-minute flight to Vancouver or Seattle</li>
<li>Over 200 downtown restaurants and pubs</li>
<li>Excellent shopping in a beautiful, clean city</li>
<li>World-famous gardens and outdoor activities</li>
</ul>
<p><a rel="noopener" href="/international-students/living-in-Canada/about-victoria" target="_blank" class="btn btn-default">Discover Victoria, BC</a></p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="dcs-lightblue-box my-5">
<h2 class="mt-4">Stay connected</h2>
<p>Have questions about where to start, our programs, or what it’s like to live and study in Victoria? Reach out today to connect.</p>
<div class="row align-items-stretch">
<div class="col-sm-4">
<div class="tag-box tag-box-v3 height-250">
<h3 class="no-margin-top">Contact</h3>
Tel: <a href="tel:12507218469">1-250-721-8469</a><br>Fax: 1-250-721-8774<br>Email: <a href="mailto:recruitasst@uvic.ca">recruitasst@uvic.ca</a><br>Web: <a rel="noopener" href="/" target="_blank" title="Continuing Studies at UVic">continuingstudies.uvic.ca</a></div>
</div>
<div class="col-sm-4 ">
<div class="tag-box tag-box-v3 height-250">
<h3 class="no-margin-top">Address</h3>
Division of Continuing Studies<br>University of Victoria<br>PO Box 1700 STN CSC<br>Victoria, BC V8W 2Y2<br>Canada</div>
</div>
<div class="col-sm-4">
<div class="tag-box tag-box-v3 height-250">
<h3 class="no-margin-top">Social media</h3>
<p><a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.facebook.com/uviccontinuingstudies" target="_blank" title="Connect with Continuing Studies on Facebook"> <i class="fab fa-lg fa-facebook-square text-dcs-blue">&nbsp;</i> /uviccontinuingstudies</a></p>
<p><a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCelwEs8oKXow1UcfnrZFYOQ" target="_blank" title="Connect with Continuing Studies on YouTube"> <i class="fab fa-lg fa-youtube-square text-dcs-blue">&nbsp;</i>@UVicContinuingStudies </a></p>
<p><a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/uviccontinuingstudies" target="_blank" title="Connect with Continuing Studies on LinkedIn"> <i class="fab fa-lg fa-linkedin text-dcs-blue">&nbsp;</i>/uviccontinuingstudies</a></p>
<p><a rel="noopener" href="https://www.facebook.com/EnglishLanguageCentre" target="_blank"><i class="fab fa-lg fa-facebook-square  text-elc-red">&nbsp;</i> /EnglishLanguageCentre&nbsp;</a></p>
<p><a rel="noopener" href="https://www.facebook.com/UVicHomestayELC" target="_blank"><i class="fab fa-lg fa-facebook-square  text-elc-red">&nbsp;</i> /UVicHomestayELC</a></p>
<p><a rel="noopener" href="https://www.instagram.com/elc_uvic/" target="_blank"><i class="fab fa-lg fa-instagram-square  text-elc-red">&nbsp;</i> /elc_uvic&nbsp;</a></p>
<p><a rel="noopener" href="https://www.youtube.com/user/EnglishLanguageUVIC/featured" target="_blank"><i class="fab fa-lg fa-youtube-square  text-elc-red">&nbsp;</i> /EnglishLanguageUVic&nbsp;</a></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="row align-items-center dcs-grey">
<div class="col-sm-8 px-5  ">
<h2>Territory acknowledgement</h2>
<div></div>
<p>We acknowledge and respect the Lək̓ʷəŋən (Songhees and Xʷsepsəm/Esquimalt) Peoples on whose territory the university stands, and the Lək̓ʷəŋən and W̱SÁNEĆ Peoples whose historical relationships with the land continue to this day.</p>
</div>
<div class="col-sm-4"><img class="img-fluid " src="/media/anopirbg/territory.jpg?width=500&amp;height=333.33333333333337" alt="Photo of the carved pole outside of the first people's house on campus." width="500" height="333.33333333333337"></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

